{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnnormalizer"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Normalization is what makes a score fully typed","anchor":"Normalization-is-what-makes-a-score-fully-typed","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser"},{"type":"text","text":" promotes only the tags that bind cleanly as written. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"normalizer performs the repairs that let the rest promote, then re-runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"promotion on the result:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"a tag-name alias is collapsed to its canonical long form;","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"a deprecated parameter name is renamed to its current one;","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"code":"$variable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reference in tag-parameter position is substituted by its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"declared value;","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"a parameter of the wrong type is dropped, since such a value is inert —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\staccato<0.5>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means the same as a bare ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\staccato","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":";","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"so is one written to a tag that keeps none, one written on an ","type":"text"},{"code":"…End","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tag, and a raw (unquoted) identifier, none of which anything reads;","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"a unit written on a parameter that cannot carry one is dropped, keeping","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the magnitude.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each of those is something Guido provably never reads, which is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"licenses the repair: the score’s meaning is unchanged and the loss is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"announced rather than silent. The one thing no repair touches is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"type":"text","text":" reference no declaration answers, which has to survive to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each is reported as a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change"},{"type":"text","text":". Re-running promotion is safe because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"promotion is a total, idempotent function of a tag’s name and parameters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the two untyped lanes as its fallback: a tag that still does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bind is carried through exactly as written."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The visible consequence is that ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"a parsed score is less typed than a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"normalized one","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". A consumer that switches over "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" should read a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"score whose ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore\/isNormalized","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"What-it-does-not-do","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"What it does not do"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Normalization never fails. Three defects survive every repair above — a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"required parameter still missing, an unnamed parameter past the end of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tag’s template, and a value the tag’s own class cannot read — and each is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carried through to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", which reports it as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". Judging is the validator’s job; this stage only"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"repairs, so a caller that wants a diagnosis calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on what it gets back."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A tag carrying one of those three stays on an untyped lane, which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gives the validator something to read. Otherwise the only untyped tags left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after normalization are the ones that belong there: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose name GMN does not reserve at all, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which is down to the three reserved names no typed payload claims —","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\port"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrHoos"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrRenz"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A type that normalizes a Guido Music Notation score to canonical form.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNNormalizer"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN13GMNNormalizerV","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"GMNNormalizer","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GMNNormalizer","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/init()"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true},{"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change"],"title":"Enumerations","generated":true}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16Se